# ── Build outputs (recursive — covers WRAITH/, WRAITH.Tests/, any project) ───
# Previously only WRAITH/bin|obj were ignored, so WRAITH.Tests/bin/** got
# committed — including duplicate copies of scanner/*.py that CodeQL then
# scanned, producing ~53 phantom path-injection alerts on generated files.
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

# ── Local build / submission scratch dirs (never committed) ──────────────────
publish-local/
publish-mf/
fp-submission/

# ── Python virtual environment ───────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# ── Runtime-generated config (contains machine-local paths) ─────────────────
wraith.env.json

# ── Scan output files ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
wraith_report_*.json
wraith_report_*.csv
wraith_report_*.html
wraith_quickscan_*.json

# ── Release artefacts (generated by test-deploy.ps1 / CI) ────────────────────
*.zip
WRAITH-v*/
publish-test/
publish-test-new/
publish-fixed/
publish/
release-test/

# ── VS / Rider IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# ── NuGet ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
packages/
project.lock.json

# ── OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
